OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing  
OL,4,A20-year-old woman                      
OL,6,FA body has been found in the search for
OL,7,Fa missing 20-year-old woman in Dumfries
OL,8,Fand Galloway.                          
OL,10,FFormal identification has not yet taken
OL,11,Fplace but the family of Kelsey Hunter  
OL,12,Fhas been informed. She was last seen in
OL,13,FCastle Douglas at 17:00 on Saturday and
OL,14,Fa major search has been taking place in
OL,15,Fher nearby home village of Springholm. 
OL,17,FDaniel McKnight, 21, appeared on       
OL,18,FTuesday on petition in Dumfries Sheriff
OL,19,FCourt charged with murder and two other
OL,20,Fcharges, including defeating the ends  
OL,21,Fof justice.                            
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
